// use this editor to enter or override the rules for transforming from the parse tree to the abstract syntax model

// '#override-default-transform' starts from the default transform, which is derived from the grammar.
// With no rules written below, the default is used for every grammar rule.
// To change the result for a grammar rule, write a rule for it in an 'asm-transform' block, e.g.
//   asm-transform BasicTutorial {
//     greeting: Greeting() { ... }
//   }
// rules that are not written keep the default.
#override-default-transform
namespace net.akehurst.language.example
